# RJ Spending Bot — Rules

## MAIN RULE
Make only surgical, targeted changes. Never rewrite entire functions or files.

## FORBIDDEN
- Rewriting existing functions entirely
- Changing code unrelated to current task
- Removing existing logic without explicit instruction
- Changing file structure
- Adding new imports unless required for the task
- Changing chat IDs or routing logic unless explicitly asked

## ALLOWED
- Adding new lines inside existing functions
- Fixing specific logic surgically
- Adding new functions at end of file
- Changing only what is explicitly specified in the task

## CODE STYLE
- Language: English only everywhere
- Every step/screen must have Back and Cancel buttons
- Superadmin sees everything
- Log errors via print()

## NOTIFICATIONS ROUTING
- Lesson changes (cancel/reschedule/add): ONLY to LESSON_GROUP_CHAT_ID with instructor tag
- Lesson reminders for instructors: ONLY to LESSON_GROUP_CHAT_ID
- GPS alerts: ONLY to SUPERADMIN_GROUP_CHAT_ID
- Financial alerts: ONLY to MANAGER_GRP_CHAT_ID and SUPERADMIN_GROUP_CHAT_ID
- SOS: SUPERADMIN_GROUP_CHAT_ID and LESSON_GROUP_CHAT_ID
- Never mix routing without explicit instruction
